\newlabel{tab:state_prep_parameters}{{4.1}{48}{* With respect to qubit transition frequency.\\ Experimental parameters used for state preparation of the ion into the $\ket {\downarrow } = \ket {4S_{1/2},~m_j = -1/2}$ state}{table.caption.17}{}}
