\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {4.11}{\ignorespaces  Motional coherence time measured by Ramsey sequence on the motional state. The blue points are the population in $\mathinner {|{\downarrow }\rangle }$ after a Ramsey sequence with varying delay time, $t_{\rm  RAM}$. The dashed line is an exponential decay fit, with a coherence time $\tau = 4.6(4)$~\unit {\ms }. }}{65}{figure.caption.34}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:motional_coherence}{{4.11}{65}{Motional coherence time measured by Ramsey sequence on the motional state. The blue points are the population in $\ket {\downarrow }$ after a Ramsey sequence with varying delay time, $t_{\rm RAM}$. The dashed line is an exponential decay fit, with a coherence time $\tau = 4.6(4)$~\unit {\ms }}{figure.caption.34}{}}
